"        согласованности выше %(limit)s означает противоречивость суждений: веса будут\n"
"        сохранены, но к расчёту схема допущена не будет.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        For each pair of criteria, state which one is more important and by how much. The weights\n"
"        are calculated as the principal eigenvector of the resulting matrix. A consistency\n"
"        ratio above %(limit)s means the judgements are contradictory: the weights will be\n"
"        saved, but the scheme will not be admitted to calculation.\n"
