"            практические последствия, спор об остальных — нет.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Perturbing the weight of criterion «%(name)s» changes the order of candidates more than any other.\n"
"            It is its weight that needs justifying first: an argument about it has\n"
"            practical consequences, an argument about the rest does not.\n"
"          "

