msgstr "The matrix is built on a single requirements model: comparing across different models would produce a table whose columns mean different things in different rows"

#: templates/competencies/matrix.html:29
msgid "Показаны первые 60 сотрудников. Таблица на две сотни строк не читается — уточните подразделение."
msgstr "The first 60 employees are shown. A table of two hundred rows is unreadable — narrow it down to a department."

