"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Model «%(model)s», employees in the sample: %(count)s. The share of\n"
"            those below the requirement is counted against all employees rather than the assessed ones:\n"
"            an unassessed employee is an unconfirmed fit too.\n"
"          "

#: templates/competencies/matrix.html:54
